{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 JumpVerse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump higher. React faster. Don\u2019t give up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JumpVerse is a precision-focused 2D platformer built for players who crave real challenge.<br>No hand-holding. No autopilot. No easy wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your timing \u2014 and the next platform.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae What You Get Right Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>6 handcrafted levels</strong> with increasing difficulty<br>\u2022 Tight, skill-based jump mechanics<br>\u2022 Hidden paths &amp; collectible special coins<br>\u2022 Classic 2D pixel art with a nostalgic feel<br>\u2022 Fast restarts \u2014 no wasted time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake is yours.<br>Every success is earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 And This Is Just The Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JumpVerse is actively expanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>A total of 18 full levels</strong><br>\u2022 New traps, obstacles &amp; mechanics<br>\u2022 Additional secrets and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy now and get all future updates as development continues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Who Is JumpVerse For?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for players who:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Love precise platformers<br>\u2714 Want to test their reflexes<br>\u2714 Enjoy discovering hidden routes<br>\u2714 Prefer skill over luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for an easy ride \u2014 this isn\u2019t it.<br>If you\u2019re ready for a challenge \u2014 welcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 The Real Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not whether you\u2019ll reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s how many times you\u2019ll restart before you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap